field/choices "a42a2ea8-8104-517f-a2c1-83cf2501a7b4"] [:db/add "a5df3437-01f3-5397-98cb-72078f3f5916" :answer-field/choices "18b79c6b-141a-5e47-9320-6f439b0fb03f"] [:db/add "a5df3437-01f3-5397-98cb-72078f3f5916" :answer-field/choices "f2b51c9b-f3b3-5b19-a1fe-7a9ce66de292"] [:db/add "a5df3437-01f3-5397-98cb-72078f3f5916" :answer-field/choices "e0455bae-e74b-5427-a76a-85ff3edc1317"] [:db/add "a5df3437-01f3-5397-98cb-72078f3f5916" :answer-field/choices "da2eccdf-714a-53a1-9f66-3d8aa577f674"] [:db/add "a5df3437-01f3-5397-98cb-72078f3f5916" :answer-field/correct "a42a2ea8-8104-517f-a2c1-83cf2501a7b4"] [:db/ensure "a5df3437-01f3-5397-98cb-72078f3f5916" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "24bdcdaf-ab24-5eb7-9897-4aa4058292eb" :question/id #uuid "24bdcdaf-ab24-5eb7-9897-4aa4058292eb"] [:db/add "24bdcdaf-ab24-5eb7-9897-4aa4058292eb" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}} 2 x e^{2 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value."] [:db/add "24bdcdaf-ab24-5eb7-9897-4aa4058292eb" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x^{2} + 1$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4 x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\x=\\sqrt{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}&\\Longrightarrow u=1 + \\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}} 2 x e^{2 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{1}^{1 + \\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $e^{\\ln 2}=2,\\quad e^{2\\ln 2}=4$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=e^{u}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left[e^{u}\\right]_{1}^{1 + \\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left(4 e\\right)-\\left(e\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 e}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "24bdcdaf-ab24-5eb7-9897-4aa4058292eb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "24bdcdaf-ab24-5eb7-9897-4aa4058292eb" :question/answer-fields "a5df3437-01f3-5397-98cb-72078f3f5916"] [:db/ensure "24bdcdaf-ab24-5eb7-9897-4aa4058292eb" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "24bdcdaf-ab24-5eb7-9897-4aa4058292eb"] [:db/add "4aea5cc7-3f32-5642-acb9-e0319af96dc2" :answer/id #uuid "4aea5cc7-3f32-5642-acb9-e0319af96dc2"] [:db/add "4aea5cc7-3f32-5642-acb9-e0319af96dc2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4aea5cc7-3f32-5642-acb9-e0319af96dc2" :answer/value "- 4 e"] [:db/ensure "4aea5cc7-3f32-5642-acb9-e0319af96dc2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "83e5ecf4-5345-529a-a8bd-c1801b64068e" :answer/id #uuid "83e5ecf4-5345-529a-a8bd-c1801b64068e"] [:db/add "83e5ecf4-5345-529a-a8bd-c1801b64068e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "83e5ecf4-5345-529a-a8bd-c1801b64068e" :answer/value "4 e"] [:db/ensure "83e5ecf4-5345-529a-a8bd-c1801b64068e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9859c69d-7782-550e-b343-95e58b509469" :answer/id #uuid "9859c69d-7782-550e-b343-95e58b509469"] [:db/add "9859c69d-7782-550e-b343-95e58b509469" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9859c69d-7782-550e-b343-95e58b509469" :answer/value "2 e"] [:db/ensure "9859c69d-7782-550e-b343-95e58b509469" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2367f4c3-a5ba-5ca0-a543-e4ec0d4d3266" :answer/id #uuid "2367f4c3-a5ba-5ca0-a543-e4ec0d4d3266"] [:db/add "2367f4c3-a5ba-5ca0-a543-e4ec0d4d3266" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2367f4c3-a5ba-5ca0-a543-e4ec0d4d3266" :answer/value "8 e"] [:db/ensure "2367f4c3-a5ba-5ca0-a543-e4ec0d4d3266" :answer/validate] [:db/add "77bc0e93-1948-5837-b8e0-0c0061b9dee4" :answer/id #uuid "77bc0e93-1948-5837-b8e0-0c0061b9dee4"] [:db/add "77bc0e93-1948-5837-b8e0-0c0061b9dee4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "77bc0e93-1948-5837-b8e0-0c0061b9dee4" :answer/value "\\frac{4 e}{3}"] [:db/ensure "77bc0e93-1948-5837-b8e0-0c0061b9dee4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a1d0866e-c90b-55c6-9686-a1d7c0e