ft(\\left[e^{u}\\right]_{1}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)} + 1}\\right)=4\\left(\\left(2 e\\right)-\\left(e\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n4 e.\n$$"] [:db/add "f406a425-58e3-5cb0-8a62-2e89af536b93" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f406a425-58e3-5cb0-8a62-2e89af536b93" :question/answer-fields "a1d0866e-c90b-55c6-9686-a1d7c0e650a6"] [:db/ensure "f406a425-58e3-5cb0-8a62-2e89af536b93" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "f406a425-58e3-5cb0-8a62-2e89af536b93"] [:db/add "fd6742df-8cb3-5526-a4da-ef6e9b8a767d" :answer/id #uuid "fd6742df-8cb3-5526-a4da-ef6e9b8a767d"] [:db/add "fd6742df-8cb3-5526-a4da-ef6e9b8a767d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fd6742df-8cb3-5526-a4da-ef6e9b8a767d" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "fd6742df-8cb3-5526-a4da-ef6e9b8a767d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5ee53119-801c-5d7a-bb64-62cc1c92a98e" :answer/id #uuid "5ee53119-801c-5d7a-bb64-62cc1c92a98e"] [:db/add "5ee53119-801c-5d7a-bb64-62cc1c92a98e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5ee53119-801c-5d7a-bb64-62cc1c92a98e" :answer/value "3"] [:db/ensure "5ee53119-801c-5d7a-bb64-62cc1c92a98e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bb380a3a-cdbc-5089-a078-318f0a79cb30" :answer/id #uuid "bb380a3a-cdbc-5089-a078-318f0a79cb30"] [:db/add "bb380a3a-cdbc-5089-a078-318f0a79cb30" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "bb380a3a-cdbc-5089-a078-318f0a79cb30" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}"] [:db/ensure "bb380a3a-cdbc-5089-a078-318f0a79cb30" :answer/validate] [:db/add "92ac924c-ab03-546c-8fc4-59089b9fb12a" :answer/id #uuid "92ac924c-ab03-546c-8fc4-59089b9fb12a"] [:db/add "92ac924c-ab03-546c-8fc4-59089b9fb12a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "92ac924c-ab03-546c-8fc4-59089b9fb12a" :answer/value "4"] [:db/ensure "92ac924c-ab03-546c-8fc4-59089b9fb12a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d00627be-806e-56e1-a0f4-adffa702335e" :answer/id #uuid "d00627be-806e-56e1-a0f4-adffa702335e"] [:db/add "d00627be-806e-56e1-a0f4-adffa702335e" :answer/type :answ