igned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $e^{\\ln 2}=2,\\quad e^{2\\ln 2}=4$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=e^{u}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\left[e^{u}\\right]_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)=2\\left(\\left(2\\right)-\\left(1\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n2.\n$$"] [:db/add "6a946e03-6181-5b4b-9cac-25d4e9fde19e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "6a946e03-6181-5b4b-9cac-25d4e9fde19e" :question/answer-fields "927abd5e-1d6a-5af0-b897-119b76a16469"] [:db/ensure "6a946e03-6181-5b4b-9cac-25d4e9fde19e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "6a946e03-6181-5b4b-9cac-25d4e9fde19e"] [:db/add "ebf49655-443a-5127-b311-79e85425e7ea" :answer/id #uuid "ebf49655-443a-5127-b311-79e85425e7ea"] [:db/add "ebf49655-443a-5127-b311-79e85425e7ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ebf49655-443a-5127-b311-79e85425e7ea" :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}"] [:db/ensure "ebf49655-443a-5127-b311-79e85425e7ea" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e2e01880-d67a-5e07-8fbb-87aeb77c0d52" :answer/id #uuid "e2e01880-d67a-5e07-8fbb-87aeb77c0d52"] [:db/add "e2e01880-d67a-5e07-8fbb-87aeb77c0d52" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e2e01880-d67a-5e07-8fbb-87aeb77c0d52" :answer/value "3"] [:db/ensure "e2e01880-d67a-5e07-8fbb-87aeb77c0d52" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1e20bdb2-f617-5b4e-818b-7ae9dce5e6ff" :answer/id #uuid "1e20bdb2-f617-5b4e-818b-7ae9dce5e6ff"] [:db/add "1e20bdb2-f617-5b4e-818b-7ae9dce5e6ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1e20bdb2-f617-5b4e-818b-7ae9dce5e6ff" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "1e20bdb2-f617-5b4e-818b-7ae9dce5e6ff" :answer/validate] [:db/add "15debcdc-0d61-565d-a7a6-2bf07ab35569" :answer/id #uuid "15debcdc-0d61-565d-a7a6-2bf07ab35569"] [:db/add "15debcdc-0d61-565d-a7a6-2bf07ab35569" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "15debcdc-0d61-565d-a7a6-2bf07ab35569" :answer/value "\\frac{7}{2}"] [:db/ensure "