he differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}} e^{2 x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $e^{\\ln 2}=2,\\quad e^{2\\ln 2}=4$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=e^{u}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left[e^{u}\\right]_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left(4\\right)-\\left(1\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "07203f15-8335-5d08-82e4-7f6bd6a8d51f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "07203f15-8335-5d08-82e4-7f6bd6a8d51f" :question/answer-fields "77e60f23-a5ed-5ad1-bd45-17f9e6222094"] [:db/ensure "07203f15-8335-5d08-82e4-7f6bd6a8d51f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "07203f15-8335-5d08-82e4-7f6bd6a8d51f"] [:db/add "54f6aa68-cc41-5701-a86d-4b4ef910e724" :answer/id #uuid "54f6aa68-cc41-5701-a86d-4b4ef910e724"] [:db/add "54f6aa68-cc41-5701-a86d-4b4ef910e724" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "54f6aa68-cc41-5701-a86d-4b4ef910e724" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "54f6aa68-cc41-5701-a86d-4b4ef910e724" :answer/validate] [:db/add "192a1f6c-a4fe-5b05-9abe-9a60c7c579bd" :answer/id #uuid "192a1f6c-a4fe-5b05-9abe-9a60c7c579bd"] [:db/add "192a1f6c-a4fe-5b05-9abe-9a60c7c579bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "192a1f6c-a4fe-5b05-9abe-9a60c7c579bd" :answer/value "3"] [:db/ensure "192a1f6c-a4fe-5b05-9abe-9a60c7c579bd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "aa0e7596-1dec-58d2-9258-7fa864a57f47" :answer/id #uuid "aa0e7596-1dec-58d2-9258-7fa864a57f47"] [:db/add "aa0e7596-1dec-58d2-9258-7fa864a57f47" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "aa0e7596-1dec-58d2-9258-7fa864a57f47" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "aa0e7596-1dec-58d2-9258-7fa864a57f47" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9b40bda3-0f78-5171-b752-a9ec490a26b3" :answer