n $\\mathrm{d}u=(2 x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\sqrt{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}} 2 x e^{x^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $e^{\\ln 2}=2,\\quad e^{2\\ln 2}=4$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=e^{u}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[e^{u}\\right]_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}=\\left(2\\right)-\\left(1\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n1.\n$$"] [:db/add "1162eac6-17c1-5233-98b3-49a36c01cb96" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "1162eac6-17c1-5233-98b3-49a36c01cb96" :question/answer-fields "96bd0d82-e2f6-533e-a230-a4279b9e6e3b"] [:db/ensure "1162eac6-17c1-5233-98b3-49a36c01cb96" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "1162eac6-17c1-5233-98b3-49a36c01cb96"] [:db/add "2693ded1-26c1-5c0d-b4c4-412355c38d90" :answer/id #uuid "2693ded1-26c1-5c0d-b4c4-412355c38d90"] [:db/add "2693ded1-26c1-5c0d-b4c4-412355c38d90" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2693ded1-26c1-5c0d-b4c4-412355c38d90" :answer/value "\\frac{9}{4}"] [:db/ensure "2693ded1-26c1-5c0d-b4c4-412355c38d90" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e97a8ef5-1dbb-5d85-8670-9499bb9eaf5e" :answer/id #uuid "e97a8ef5-1dbb-5d85-8670-9499bb9eaf5e"] [:db/add "e97a8ef5-1dbb-5d85-8670-9499bb9eaf5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e97a8ef5-1dbb-5d85-8670-9499bb9eaf5e" :answer/value "\\frac{9}{2}"] [:db/ensure "e97a8ef5-1dbb-5d85-8670-9499bb9eaf5e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8ba79cc8-bf17-5634-bca9-40d441d938d0" :answer/id #uuid "8ba79cc8-bf17-5634-bca9-40d441d938d0"] [:db/add "8ba79cc8-bf17-5634-bca9-40d441d938d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8ba79cc8-bf17