\left(2 \\right)}} 3 e^{2 x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value."] [:db/add "0c4ed185-75bb-5475-8582-73fab14779ef" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}} 3 e^{2 x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $e^{\\ln 2}=2,\\quad e^{2\\ln 2}=4$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=e^{u}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\left[e^{u}\\right]_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}}\\right)=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\left(4\\right)-\\left(1\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{9}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "0c4ed185-75bb-5475-8582-73fab14779ef" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "0c4ed185-75bb-5475-8582-73fab14779ef" :question/answer-fields "8e9c99ac-9267-5c5a-bc04-4c4131e0494e"] [:db/ensure "0c4ed185-75bb-5475-8582-73fab14779ef" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "0c4ed185-75bb-5475-8582-73fab14779ef"] [:db/add "c5cb16b4-b62c-58a7-988e-a43c4be2687d" :answer/id #uuid "c5cb16b4-b62c-58a7-988e-a43c4be2687d"] [:db/add "c5cb16b4-b62c-58a7-988e-a43c4be2687d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c5cb16b4-b62c-58a7-988e-a43c4be2687d" :answer/value "e"] [:db/ensure "c5cb16b4-b62c-58a7-988e-a43c4be2687d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4579a606-705a-5b81-92f9-e9a771902eed" :answer/id #uuid "4579a606-705a-5b81-92f9-e9a771902eed"] [:db/add "4579a606-705a-5b81-92f9-e9a771902eed" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4579a606-705a-5b81-92f9-e9a771902eed" :answer/value "- \\frac{e}{2}"] [:db/ensure "4579a606-705a-5b81-92f9-e9a771902ee