choices "9a07d953-17e6-5229-901b-2c75990a8b05"] [:db/add "1ef5cd53-d8af-5c45-b2f1-7692b75aa93c" :answer-field/choices "036e3781-356a-57c7-bd36-1660aa1b0f1b"] [:db/add "1ef5cd53-d8af-5c45-b2f1-7692b75aa93c" :answer-field/correct "c15c9c6c-72dc-5029-a194-4ac26de2648a"] [:db/ensure "1ef5cd53-d8af-5c45-b2f1-7692b75aa93c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5e90f8ba-50a9-529a-9dd5-db0308df9cdc" :question/id #uuid "5e90f8ba-50a9-529a-9dd5-db0308df9cdc"] [:db/add "5e90f8ba-50a9-529a-9dd5-db0308df9cdc" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}} 3 e^{x + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value."] [:db/add "5e90f8ba-50a9-529a-9dd5-db0308df9cdc" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x + 2$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(1)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=2\\\\x=\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)} + 2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}} 3 e^{x + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int_{2}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)} + 2} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $e^{\\ln 2}=2,\\quad e^{2\\ln 2}=4$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=e^{u}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\left[e^{u}\\right]_{2}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)} + 2}\\right)=3\\left(\\left(2 e^{2}\\right)-\\left(e^{2}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n3 e^{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "5e90f8ba-50a9-529a-9dd5-db0308df9cdc" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "5e90f8ba-50a9-529a-9dd5-db0308df9cdc" :question/answer-fields "1ef5cd53-d8af-5c45-b2f1-7692b75aa93c"] [:db/ensure "5e90f8ba-50a9-529a-9dd5-db0308df9cdc" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "5e90f8ba-50a9-529a-9dd5-db0308df9cdc"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "9beb9b28-d4ce-5d84-873b-5e1e13e4f4